sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Checkout
    participant Inventory
    participant Payment
    participant Fraud
    participant Fulfillment
    participant Replay

    Customer->>Checkout: Place Order
    Checkout->>Checkout: Create checkoutIntentId + idempotency key
    Checkout->>Inventory: Check freshness + create inventoryHoldId
    Inventory-->>Checkout: inventoryHoldId
    Checkout->>Payment: Authorize payment
    Payment-->>Checkout: paymentAuthId
    Checkout->>Fraud: Check risk/policy
    Fraud-->>Checkout: pass/review/refuse
    Checkout->>Fulfillment: Validate cutoff
    Fulfillment-->>Checkout: eligible
    Checkout->>Inventory: Promote hold to reservation
    Inventory-->>Checkout: reservationId
    Checkout->>Replay: Emit replay card
    Checkout-->>Customer: Confirmed with orderCommitId
